      "id": "F15-content-derived-identity-observations",
      "root_cause": "source_id/document_id derive from content SHA; same-path re-registration rebinds the (root_id,relative_path) location via ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE, so an old ref then refuses with no_indexed_location after a content change",
      "disposition": "ROOT_SUGGESTION_DOCUMENT_CONTRACT",
      "evidence": "findings.md F15; e2e attempt-0003 S3 (same_content_same_ids) and S5 (old ref no_indexed_location)",
